From 0cb245e2e885b825dd8305048fcf1b2e89ce356a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Destrudos6 <3411622425@qq.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 14:19:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] 0060: Fix audited bugs in translation, lookup, backup and
 update flows

Fixes for real-world problems found in a full audit of the 59-patch stack.
Every change is behaviour-preserving except where noted:

- BisubManager: untranslated cues were written twice into the bilingual VTT
  (the dedup map was pre-filled with the original text, and composeBilingual
  writes the second line for any non-empty value), so partially translated
  videos showed every missing line twice; the placeholder is empty now.
- BisubManager: a run that translated zero lines still wrote the .done marker
  and reported success, which also promoted a half-written cache from an
  earlier run; it now fails so the user can retry.
- BisubManager: automatic cache cleanup silently stopped deleting anything as
  soon as the oldest entry was pinned to the reading shelf; pinned entries are
  skipped instead of aborting the pass.
- BisubManager: the ReCaptcha activity was opened with the timedtext subtitle
  URL, a page that cannot render a solvable challenge; open YouTube instead
  (upstream default) and never let a blocked background activity start hide
  the original download error.
- SubtitleTranslator: a base URL with a path (the built-in Zhipu/GLM preset is
  .../api/paas/v4) got /v1/chat/completions appended and always returned 404;
  a path-carrying base now only gets /chat/completions, a bare host keeps /v1.
- YoudaoDictionary/WordLookupService: a malformed HTTP 200 reply was cached as
  an empty entry, so that word could never be looked up again until restart.
- BisubSubtitleView: clamp the wrap width to the video area (not the whole
  letterboxed surface) so fullscreen playback wraps like the style editor
  preview; restore the per-layer text size before drawing (both layers share
  one TextPaint and StaticLayout keeps a reference to it).
- Player: playSilently() left the silent-transition flag behind when playback
  was already running (no state transition), which silenced the next manual
  pause; skip the call in that case.
- WordBook: serialize the read-modify-write methods; a background Maimemo sync
  and a foreground add/remove could overwrite each other and lose a word.
- CloudBackupManager: Context#getDataDir() is API 24 but minSdk is 23; use
  ContextCompat.getDataDir(). Open the database before checkpoint() so the
  periodic Worker (cold process, App.onCreate does not open it) no longer
  fails silently and automatic cloud backups actually run.
- BisubUpdateChecker: pick the APK matching the device ABI instead of the
  first asset (the arm64 package was downloaded on 32-bit/x86 devices), refuse
  to install a truncated cached APK (an interrupted download used to fail
  permanently for that release), run the 60+ MB copy/install off the main
  thread (ANR), and never show dialogs on a destroyed activity (BadToken
  crash after leaving the About page during a slow request).
- build.gradle: use the _nio desugar variant so java.nio.file works on
  Android 6/7 (minSdk 23), where the bisub cache/reader/backup used to crash.
---
